        "# 🤖 Autonomous Job Search & Notion Tracker Agent\n",
        "### Data Analytics Roles in São Paulo, Brazil\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook automates your job hunt in **São Paulo** for **Data Analytics / Analista de Dados** positions:\n",
        "1. **Daily Online Search**: Aggregates new openings from LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor, Gupy, Greenhouse & Lever.\n",
        "2. **Local Deduplication**: Remembers previously discovered roles in `jobs_tracker_data.json` so you only review fresh positions.\n",
        "3. **Interactive Review**: Displays links, company details, tech stack, and salary ranges.\n",
        "4. **Direct Notion Sync**: When you apply, 1-click logs the application to your Notion **\"Job Application Tracker\"** database.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "### 📋 Notion Database Schema Requirements\n",
        "In your Notion workspace, create a database named **\"Job Application Tracker\"** with these exact properties:\n",
        "| Property Name | Type | Notes |\n",
        "| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n",
        "| **Job Title** | `Title` | Position name (e.g. Senior Data Analyst) |\n",
        "| **Company** | `Text` (or Rich Text) | Company name (e.g. Nubank, Itaú) |\n",
        "| **Status** | `Select` | Options: `Applied`, `Interviewing`, `Offer`, `Rejected` |\n",
        "| **Date Applied** | `Date` | Timestamp of when you applied (YYYY-MM-DD) |\n",
        "| **Location** | `Text` | e.g. São Paulo, SP (Híbrido) |\n",
        "| **Job URL** | `URL` | Direct apply link |\n",
        "| **Salary** | `Text` | Expected or listed salary range |\n",
        "| **Notes** | `Text` | Referral info, resume version, comments |\n"
      ]
    },
