      "source": [
        "## ⏰ Automated Daily Schedule\n",
        "To have this agent run automatically every morning at 08:00 AM (São Paulo time) without keeping your computer on:\n",
        "\n",
        "### Method A: GitHub Actions (100% Free Cloud Cron)\n",
        "Create a repository on GitHub, add `NOTION_API_KEY` and `NOTION_DATABASE_ID` to **Settings > Secrets > Actions**, and save this workflow at `.github/workflows/daily_job_search.yml`:\n",
        "\n",
        "```yaml\n",
        "name: Daily São Paulo Data Jobs Search\n",
        "on:\n",
        "  schedule:\n",
        "    # Runs at 11:00 UTC (08:00 São Paulo BRT) Monday through Friday\n",
        "    - cron: \"0 11 * * 1-5\"\n",
        "  workflow_dispatch: # Allows manual trigger button\n",
        "\n",
        "jobs:\n",
        "  search:\n",
        "    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n",
        "    steps:\n",
        "      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n",
        "      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n",
        "        with:\n",
        "          python-version: \"3.11\"\n",
        "      - run: pip install requests\n",
        "      - name: Run Search Agent\n",
        "        env:\n",
        "          NOTION_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.NOTION_API_KEY }}\n",
        "          NOTION_DATABASE_ID: ${{ secrets.NOTION_DATABASE_ID }}\n",
        "        run: python agent.py search\n",
        "```\n"
